From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 06:08:37 +0000
Subject: fix(compose): route profiler log output to the platform logger

LogOutputStrategy logged through KLog, which depends on a live Pager and
could throw when the profiler flushed after the page was gone. Route the
per-frame and report lines to a small expect/actual platform logger
(android.util.Log on Android, println on JS and native) instead.

Fork-Patch: compose-profiler-log-output
Origin: b79a43f2 34efdcbf
Upstream-Status: pending
Signed-off-by: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>

